# Reference Planar v41

Unapproved planar master, generated with built-in image tool. Source reference reconstructed with occluded portions inferred. Broad connected shadow planes and asymmetric tall right / low left silhouette prioritized. No polar regeneration or level change. Source still reaches side boundaries; endpoint finishing needed before standalone module deployment.

## Prompt

Redraw the CLOUDS ONLY from the supplied reference as a wide flat planar cloud master, not a polar atlas. The user dislikes AI's stereotyped clouds. Faithfully use the actual reference's restrained flat animation-background shapes.
Reconstruct the visible clouds, remove all text/logos/house/terrain/people/QR; infer occluded regions quietly. Match composition: huge broad tall bank on right, broad asymmetric plateau tower around center-right, wide saddle then higher sloping shoulder at far right; long shallow distant cloud layers at bottom-left. Mostly empty upper-left sky. Preserve horizontal elongated proportions and several overlapping broad gray cloud layers.
MOST IMPORTANT: Do not decorate contours with repeated small round scallops. Draw long continuous slightly irregular curves and flat stretches, with only occasional broad unequal changes in direction. No beaded edges, lace, serrations, broccoli, cauliflower, repeated puffs, scalloped shadow borders or brush stamp texture. Small incidental unevenness only, never a repeated rhythm. Do not blur away shape: use clean deliberate painted boundaries. Avoid rounding every change into a circular bump. The shapes have calm uneven shoulders, shallow broad notches and natural asymmetry, like the reference.
Inside clouds: two to four large flat connected tonal masses, lower midgray shadow dominates. Shadows have long quiet gently angular/curved silhouettes, not cloud-shaped rows of little lobes. Soft restrained color transitions inside broad planes, no speckling or microdetail. Light gray filled top faces, NOT white outlines or bright tiny rims. Long low horizontal shelves only in a few reference-like places, not many long knife tails. No added ornamental wisps. Very sparse detail, natural hand-painted shape design.
Grayscale on opaque pure black empty sky, one wide composition. Complete natural cloud endpoints inside small black side margins so the artwork can later be deformed as a module. Flat natural painted reference feel, not photorealistic and not a cute cloud icon. Output only artwork, no captions.
